ve two monitors with 1.5x and 1.0x scaling\n- Enable \"Prefer Wayland\" in the editor settings\n- Run the application\n- Drag the window between the two monitors\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A: not project dependent","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118625/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118625/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}